{"id": "2338424", "name": "שימושי האינטגרל – ערך ממוצע של פונקציה", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "none", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"width: 100%; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color: #1f2937; line-height: 1.65; text-align: right;\" title=\"BGU_STACK_Q9_APPLICATIONS_V1\">\n<div style=\"background: #F4F1F5; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 14px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f; margin-bottom: 8px;\">חשבו את הערך הממוצע של הפונקציה</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.9;\">\\(\\displaystyle f(x)={{CT:0}}\\)</div>\n<div style=\"margin-top: 8px;\">בקטע <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle [{{CT:1}},{{CT:2}}]\\)</span>.</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 14px;\">\n<div style=\"font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f; margin-bottom: 10px;\">התשובה</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 17px; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\\(\\displaystyle f_{\\mathrm{avg}}=\\frac{1}{{{CT:2}}-{{CT:1}}}\\int_{{{CT:1}}}^{{{CT:2}}}f(x)\\,dx\\)</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center;\">[[input:ans1]]</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center; color: #665f6b; font-size: 13px; margin-top: 8px;\">[[validation:ans1]]</div>\n</div>\n</div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"width: 100%; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color: #1f2937; line-height: 1.65; text-align: right;\" title=\"BGU_STACK_Q9_APPLICATIONS_V1\">\n<div style=\"background: #F4F1F5; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 14px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f;\">פתרון מלא</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 14px;\">\n<p>לפי הגדרת הערך הממוצע</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 17px;\">\\(\\displaystyle f_{\\mathrm{avg}}=\\frac{1}{{{CT:2}}-{{CT:1}}}\\int_{{{CT:1}}}^{{{CT:2}}}f(x)\\,dx\\)</div>\n<p>הקצוות <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle {{CT:1}}\\)</span> ו־<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle {{CT:2}}\\)</span> הם מספרים שלמים, והתדירות <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle {{CT:3}}\\)</span> שלמה. לכן האיבר הטריגונומטרי משלים מספר שלם של מחזורים על הקטע, והאינטגרל שלו שווה לאפס.</p>\n<p>נשאר לחשב רק את החלק הפולינומי והקבוע</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 17px;\">\\(\\displaystyle f_{\\mathrm{avg}}={{CT:4}}+\\frac{{{CT:5}}}{{{CT:2}}-{{CT:1}}}\\cdot\\frac{({{CT:2}})^{{CT:6}}-({{CT:1}})^{{CT:6}}}{{{CT:7}}+1}\\)</div>\n<p>ולכן</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold;\">\\(\\displaystyle f_{\\mathrm{avg}}={{CT:8}}\\)</div>\n</div>\n</div>", "specificfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">\n<div>[[feedback:prt1]]</div>\n</div>", "prtcorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"correct\">תשובה נכונה.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"partially\">התשובה נכונה חלקית.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"incorrect\">התשובה אינה נכונה.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 24, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 3, "syntaxhint": "תשובה מדויקת", "syntaxattribute": 1, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "ta", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["a", "b", "c0", "c1", "c2", "f", "k", "len", "n", "osc", "ta"], "nvariants": 50}